# ===================================================================
# Aryan Yadav Portfolio — Environment Configuration
# ===================================================================

# OPTION 1: Web3Forms (Recommended — 100% Free & No Backend Required)
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter your email
# 2. Paste the access key you receive here:
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_access_key_here

# OPTION 2: Formspree
# 1. Create a form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Paste your endpoint URL here:
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your_form_id

# OPTION 3: Custom Backend API
# VITE_CONTACT_API_URL=https://your-api.com/api/contact
